sequenceDiagram
    actor Lecturer
    participant Web as React Web App
    participant Api as GradeBridge API
    participant Parser as Parser Adapter
    participant Validator as Validation Engine
    participant Db as SQL Server
    participant Transfer as Transfer Adapter

    Lecturer->>Web: Upload optical result file
    Web->>Api: POST /import-jobs/upload
    Api->>Db: Create ImportJob
    Api->>Parser: Parse file
    Parser-->>Api: Parsed rows
    Api->>Validator: Validate rows
    Validator-->>Api: Validation results
    Api->>Db: Save parsed rows
    Api-->>Web: ImportJobId + summary
    Lecturer->>Web: Review and approve
    Web->>Api: POST /import-jobs/{id}/approve
    Api->>Db: Mark rows approved
    Lecturer->>Web: Trigger transfer/export
    Web->>Api: POST /import-jobs/{id}/transfer
    Api->>Transfer: Transfer approved grades
    Transfer-->>Api: Transfer result
    Api->>Db: Save transfer log
    Api-->>Web: Transfer report
